## Highlights
A novel ZnZr bimetallic MOFs prepared by the method of MOF-on-MOF;   
Zn-MOF-on-Zr-MOF exhibits the hierarchically decussated foliace;   
Zr-MOF-on-Zn-MOF is the multilayered nanosheets structure;   
